cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Polymer Informatics Atlas
message: If you use this repository, please cite the archived software release and the source dataset.
type: software
version: 1.0.0
authors:
  - family-names: Orji
    given-names: Dennis Obinna
repository-code: https://github.com/dennisorji/polymer-informatics-atlas
url: https://github.com/dennisorji/polymer-informatics-atlas
license: MIT
date-released: 2026-09-14
abstract: >-
  A six-notebook polymer informatics workflow integrating chemical data auditing,
  polymer representation design, property-specific modelling, chemistry-aware
  generalization, masked multitask learning, calibrated predictive reliability,
  Morgan-environment interpretation, and an integrated Polymer Informatics Atlas.
keywords:
  - polymer informatics
  - materials informatics
  - machine learning
  - polymer chemistry
  - uncertainty quantification
  - conformal prediction
  - molecular fingerprints
  - structure-property relationships
